            "title": "",
            "subtext": "",
            "text": "<p>The usable depth of all our wall cupboards is 220mm so they will not accommodate dinner plates. Dot or petal pattern cut-outs available for an additional \u00a370 per door. All prices shown include VAT.</p>",
